{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18244","headline":"独钓四首 二 · 韩愈","name":"独钓四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一迳向池斜，池搪野草花。\n雨多添柳耳，水长减蒲芽。\n坐厌亲刑柄，偷来傍钓车。\n太平公事少，吏隐讵相赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}